<<~ ahu slot=`#/head`>>

! carriage.bag.cools ~ a bag registers cold: its URL stands known, its tiddlers stay unloaded

`register-cold <bag-url>` marks a bag URL known-but-not-loaded: the oracle entry alone, with no tiddlers loaded. It rides the vessel's residency runner and needs `lares vessel stand foreground=true`.

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/shows`>>

!! shows ~ register-cold

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`example` name=`register-cold` params=`url/<bag-url> ~ mark the bag known and leave it unloaded`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/takes`>>

!! takes ~ url

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`arg` name=`url` params=`takes/bag-url needs/required seat/1 as/<bag-url> ~ the bag's URL`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/gate`>>

!! gate ~ write

Testimony: the door checks; this slot grants nothing.

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`gate` name=`write` params=`who/seat-or-hand ~ a residency command through the vessel; it loads no tiddler`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/refuses`>>

!! refuses ~ usage · daemon-unreachable

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`usage` params=`cure/[[carriage.bag.cools url/<bag-url>]] ~ the bag's URL stands required`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`daemon-unreachable` params=`~ no vessel stands in the foreground; run lares vessel stand foreground=true`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/answers`>>

!! answers ~ registered

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`band` name=`registered` params=`exit/0 ~ the bag registered cold`>>
```

